# Dependencies & virtualenvs
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/node_modules/
**/.yarn/cache/
**/.pnpm-store/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/htmlcov/
**/coverage/
**/.coverage
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/out/

# Lockfiles (noisy for agents; still committed in git)
**/uv.lock
**/yarn.lock
**/package-lock.json
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/poetry.lock
**/Cargo.lock

# Local env & secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Stale agent report dumps (keep latest STATUS; ignore bulky trees)
qa/**/artifacts/
qa/**/*.png
qa/**/*.webm
qa/**/*.zip
security/**/artifacts/
reviews/**/artifacts/

# IDE / OS noise
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.log